id=netstats-fix-lite
name=Network Stats Fix (Proxy + fake BPF maps - Lite)
version=v16-lite
versionCode=16
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Lightweight fix for broken traffic indicator. Creates+pins the netd BPF maps (exact layouts libnetworkstats.so expects) and keeps them populated from /proc/net/dev. No bpfloader restart - safe for devices where BPF restoration causes 'no internet'. Also /proc/uid_stat/ + xt_qtaguid fallbacks. Native binder proxy v10.0 with dynamic interfaces and per-UID stat distribution. Extensive logging.